  "diagnosis": "VF3 retains separate P1/common and P2 credit banks in Backup RAM. The original COMMON configuration combines both coin slots; INDIVIDUAL configuration keeps both banks. Default play costs two credits, so one saved credit displays 1/2 and is still cleared at desktop session start. VF3 stays in attract until Start, unlike Daytona2. Service credits share the credit bank and have separate lifetime accounting.",
