  "launchPolicy": "Only bundled local.william.virtuafighter3 interactive process creation clears credits. --headless, --self-test, --diagnostic-run and --audio-replay bypass it. --audio-report by itself remains interactive; explicit test-copy save directories are supported. In-session engine reset does not run cleanup.",
  "formatPolicy": "Parse all three exact CBlockFile blocks, lengths and terminators; require the VF3 EEPROM signatures and Backup RAM signature; reject unfamiliar or malformed formats before backup/write. Missing and all-zero saves are no-ops. Preserve a SHA256-named exact original backup before an atomic narrow update.",
  "scope": "Bounded original-program reference analysis and actual Swift helper tests using isolated save copies and ordinary input. Both P1/P2 and service credits were exercised. Game settings for INDIVIDUAL mode were authored using the original Test/Service menu. This is not physical-board, exhaustive gameplay, native parity, live-performance, or packaged-GUI proof. No supplied ROM, upstream source, real user save, or preferences was modified."
